  "narrative": "The conceptual domain model outlines the application's workspace and specification hierarchy. A User manages multiple Projects, each containing exactly one Spec. This Spec serves as a unified container composed of exactly one Use Case Model, Data Model, and Class Diagram. Requirements are tracked within the Use Case Model as individual Use Case Items. Non-Functional Requirements (NFRs) can be scoped globally directly to the Use Case Model, or locally to a specific Use Case Item."
